Mesa 26.2.1 v3d_shc statistics and 7.1 disassembly of the QPU words it emits
for our gl_test texture, mipmap and cube programs, written by gen.py. It has no comment header because
tools/v3d/check71.d/gltest_mesa71_tex.sh compares it with Mesa's disassembler
line for line.
